---
const { active = '' } = Astro.props;
const links = [{href:'/',label:'홈'},{href:'/calculators/percent/',label:'계산기'},{href:'/about/',label:'서비스 소개'}];
---
<header class="sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-black/5 bg-paper/90 backdrop-blur"><div class="mx-auto flex h-[72px] max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5"><a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-forest text-lg font-extrabold text-white">딱</span><span class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight">딱계산</span></a><nav class="flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-8">{links.map(link=><a href={link.href} class={`text-sm font-semibold transition hover:text-forest ${active===link.label?'text-forest':'text-muted'}`}>{link.label}</a>)}</nav></div></header><slot/><footer class="border-t border-black/5 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-4 px-5 py-8 text-sm text-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p>© 2026 딱계산 · 계산은 브라우저에서 처리됩니다.</p><nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-forest">서비스 소개</a><a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-forest">개인정보 처리방침</a><a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-forest">이용약관</a><a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-forest">문의</a></nav></div></footer>
